      "title": "Directory",
      "description": "Directory : University of Dayton, Ohio Skip to content /////// Directory Home Navigation Student Mailing Addresses arrow_forward Frequently Contacted Offices arrow_forward Faculty and Staff Directory This directory provides information about faculty and staff who have opted to provide their information. If you can't find the person you're looking for, we invite you to view our list of frequently contacted departments or email please email info@udayton.edu . Current students, faculty and staff should use the people search in Porches for additional information. Search Student Mailing Addresses arrow_forward Frequently Contacted Offices arrow_forward Related Links Connect with UD Centers and Institutes Academic Programs Social Media Directory Alumni Association University Calendar and Events Take the Next Step Apply for Admission Visit Campus Explore Careers at UD Explore Majors and Programs Academic Calendar Careers Libraries News Next Steps Request Info Apply Visit Give Connect Facebook X Instagram Youtube Linkedin Directions Contact Us 300 College Park Dayton, Ohio 45469 937-229-1000 info@udayton.edu Porches Policies Safety Report a Concern Privacy Nondiscrimination Compliance"
